ming for your school team, or just having fun with friends, XRHoops gives you the confidence to shoot with precision. Download now and start swishing those shots.", "short_description": "\ud83c\udfc0 XRHoops \u2013 Elevate Your Shot with Mixed Reality!\nXRHoops is your personal mixed reality basketball coach on Meta Quest 3. Visualize the perfect shot with a parabolic arc, guiding you to consistent accuracy. Train anywhere, anytime. Whether you\u2019re aiming for your school team or just having fun, XRHoops makes every shot count.\n\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://media-showcase-patrickalexan11.replit.app/#privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "ST Studios", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://media-showcase-patrickalexan11.replit.app/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "810139357995560"}, {"id": "514087707868786"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING", "OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "24564816076453408"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 2, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "722774733933279"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "3781135298809261"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "722774733933279"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1753735620, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "722774733933279"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_